<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">In the profiles</h2><ul class="yr-prof"><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/russian-sfsr"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Russian%20SFSR.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Russian SFSR</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Boris Yeltsin is elected president and resists the August coup</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/russian-sfsr"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Russian%20SFSR.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Russian SFSR</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The republic is renamed the Russian Federation on 25 December</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/republic-of-lithuania"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Republic%20of%20Lithuania.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Republic of Lithuania</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Soviet troops kill fourteen civilians at the Vilnius television tower</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/republic-of-estonia"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Republic%20of%20Estonia.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Republic of Estonia</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Independence is restored on 20 August</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/republic-of-latvia"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Republic%20of%20Latvia.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Republic of Latvia</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Full independence is restored on 21 August</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/soviet-union"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Soviet%20Union.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Soviet Union</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Soviet Union is dissolved on 26 December</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/republic-of-india"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Republic%20of%20India.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Republic of India</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Economic liberalisation begins after a balance-of-payments crisis</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/republic-of-somaliland"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Republic%20of%20Somaliland.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Republic of Somaliland</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Independence is declared at Burao on 18 May</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/republic-of-colombia"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Republic%20of%20Colombia.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Republic of Colombia</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">A new constitution replaces the charter of 1886</span></li></ul></section>
